From 2f7ee46439e742a393dfb1b3cb5c37d78d48e1d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:50:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: follow upstream's renamed skills/browser helpers after
 the upstream merge [daveey]

The merge kept fork callers of names upstream renamed or deleted:
- kanban_capabilities / kanban_skill_check imported tools.skills_tool._locate_skill,
  _skill_search_dirs and _find_all_skills (now public: locate_skill, skill_search_dirs,
  find_all_skills, 93fafc4d6ff); kanban skill checks raised ImportError (5 tests in test_kanban_requires_declaration red).
- browser_agent_lifecycle read the CDP override from tools.browser_tool_cdp, deleted with the
  built-in browser_* tools (68500d9ff94); it now uses tools.browser_session_cdp.
- The fork's browser_exec tests move to browser_session_lifecycle/_cdp/_cloud; the managed-lease
  test of the deleted built-in tools goes with them.
---
